At this affinity you are willing to: basic_services, personal_lore, side_quests
Memory of past interactions: {"topics":["plain world text topic"],"visits":"3"}

Quest history with this player: Previously completed quests from you: plain world text quest. You can reference these for narrative continuity and offer follow-up quests that build on past adventures.

The player has 1/5 active quests (can accept more).
Nearby locations: plain world text nearby
Enemies in the area: plain world text enemy (level 2, at plain world text lair)
